Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.77,0:01:23.90,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}是否就可以不再道別互為永遠了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.90,0:01:26.90,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}明日　きみがいないのなら
