Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.14,0:02:01.27,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}這理所當然的奇蹟
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.27,0:02:04.27,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}明日　きみと生きれるなら
